  "description": "MediatR integration for Vali-Validation. Adds a ValidationBehavior<TRequest, TResponse>\n            pipeline behavior that automatically validates IRequest objects using Vali-Validation\n            before they reach their handler. Throws ValidationException on failure.\n            Use Vali-Mediator.Validation instead if you use Vali-Mediator — it provides\n            richer integration with Result<T> support (no exceptions needed).",
  "iconFile": "VV.png",
