  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 — Initial release.\n            - ValidationBehavior<TRequest, TResponse> implementing MediatR IPipelineBehavior.\n            - Validates request via IValidator<TRequest> resolved from DI.\n            - Throws ValidationException if validation fails (use Vali-Mediator.Validation for Result-based flow).\n            - AddMediatRWithValidation() convenience extension for one-call registration.\n            - AddValiValidationBehavior() for manual MediatR setup.",
